h:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B8%A9%E5%A6%AE%E5%BC%97%E9%9B%B7%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"温妮弗雷德\"><img alt=\"温妮弗雷德\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B8%A9%E5%A6%AE%E5%BC%97%E9%9B%B7%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"温妮弗雷德\">温妮弗雷德</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>S01</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305104</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1jineng</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305104/1技能（压缩）.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305104/1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305104/2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305104/2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305104/大招(压缩）.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305104/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305104/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3051/305104/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">这是丰产的季节。<br />金黄色的麦穗低垂着，很快被镰刀收割。远处的天幕之下，谷壳的金色流淌成了一条河，与天际低垂的蓝相互交融。<br />所有人的第一个母亲，是这片土地。它孕育了目之所及的一切，河流是她细纹的沟壑，山丘是她唇峰的侧影。石榴树扎根于此，绽放出勃勃生机。<br />温妮弗雷德沿着黄金的足迹追寻至此。她俯身拾起沙石中艳彩的宝石，意外于自己看到如此美丽的风光。丰沃的大地孕育了黄金与矿藏，也赐予了生灵一片如此安宁而祥和的家园。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305104\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305107.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/66/Belonging-305107.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">一捧丰饶<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Cornucopia\" Pouch</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />150<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>来自田野的珍藏，谷穗与翎羽在此一同绽放。<br />时尚的轮回正如节令的轮回，受访者如是表示。在那状如牛角的小包中，贮藏了丰收当季的种种出产，以贵金属凝固为永恒的模样。<br />这在社交界引起了一阵推测：受访者的怪奇商品是否即将拓展？她对此仅回以微笑。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305108.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a8/Belonging-305108.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">悬垂的翎羽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Iris of the Plume\" Earrings</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />200<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>色泽变幻的宝石耳坠，据传，出品自希腊南部某家宝石工坊。<br />这对宝石的眩光随角度变化而流动，正如天后爱禽的尾羽上永不闭合的眼睛。<br />“哦，亲爱的，在谈话时，你可以看向你喜欢的那一双眼睛。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305109.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/87/Belonging-305109.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">时节的女皇<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Empress of the Seasons\" Tiara</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1500<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>每位女皇都应当有自己的冠冕，这一位也不例外。<br />黄金、松石与孔雀石经过精心雕琢，镶嵌于发带之上，如同十二颗星辰。工作自有时日，无论神话与岁月如何流转，时节的规则不以人的意志为转移，这是百年岁月中的一点不变之物。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B21.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 以黄金哺育1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B21.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B21.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B21.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B21.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B21.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B21.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B22.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 以黄金哺育2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B22.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B22.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B22.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B22.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B22.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B22.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">以黄金哺育 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Golden Nurturer</small></span></span>"}}